<p>
  Thai script's no-space writing system, the Line-centric contact ecosystem, and lèse-majesté cultural sensitivity make Thai one of the more technically and culturally demanding localizations. Leap handles Thai script rendering and layout configuration automatically — so your Thai site displays correctly without manual CSS workarounds.
